  "description": "Stand out at the skatepark or in the neighborhood with the 20\" Kent Spector BMX Bike, a truly one-of-a-kind ride. Designed with a bold split-paint frame, half black and half white, the Spector brings unique style to every cruise. Even the tires are split-color to match, making this BMX bike unlike anything else on the block. Built with a durable steel frame and fork, the Spector is tough. The 20\" wheels paired with BMX-ready tires deliver control and grip, while the front & rear hand brakes provide great stopping power. The deluxe padded saddle is height adjustable, while the handlebar is angle adjustable, allowing for the perfect fit. Perfect for riders ages 7 - 13, the Kent Spector BMX is more than just a bike, it’s a statement. This kids BMX bike is built to perform and guaranteed to stand out.\n\nYou can find this bike exclusively at Walmart!",
